{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":85896,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"veryvalentine\" data-cid=\"1895435\" data-time=\"1430856510\">Hey!  I'm just catching up on your thread.  I like what you are going to do with the little \"messages in a bottle\"  we are doing the table number idea with them....\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1895469\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430904609,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85892,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAfter 110 hours in two weeks, I finally have the chance to stop in here and see what you ladies are up to.\n \nWe had some news yesterday that is a bit concerning but hoping it works itself out. I was back in the ER a few weeks back. Panic mode thinking it was another blood clot...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1895480\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430904337,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85890,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nRight. time to get help again please. Shoes. I knew I wanted blue. The question is what colour of blue. Thanks to @  the question of shoes has come to the forefront and she has fabulous taste!! lol\n \nSo - here are a couple that I'm looking at:\n \n \n ...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893640\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430904273,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85864,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Meandhim mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1895489\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" I'm so sorry to hear you are having more medical problems after all you've been through all ready!! I'll be sending all my good karma your way. \n\nThe key holders look awesome! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430895508,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85858,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that maybeoneday mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1895487\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Wishing you all the best for your tests and results.  You sound like one hell of a fighter so I'm sure it will be fine in the end [emoji256] \n\nMaybeoneday\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430874235,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85855,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that vancouverpetunia mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1895486\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" - Sending good vibes your way. Glad you are getting the tests done quickly. Waiting can be the worst part.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430872116,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85795,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"veryvalentine\" data-cid=\"1895435\" data-time=\"1430856510\">Hey!  I'm just catching up on your thread.  I like what you are going to do with the little \"messages in a bottle\"  we are doing the table number idea with them....\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1895469\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430867558,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85793,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Dress - Never Worn....","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"krystalball\" data-cid=\"1895444\" data-time=\"1430861993\">This is my dress: http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844\n \n...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79150-wedding-dress-never-worn-mermaid-style\/?view=findpost&p=1895460\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430867500,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85786,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"veryvalentine\" data-cid=\"1895435\" data-time=\"1430856510\">Hey!  I'm just catching up on your thread.  I like what you are going to do with the little \"messages in a bottle\"  we are doing the table number idea with them....\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1895469\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430867318,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85774,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1895468\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" I honestly completely understand what it feels like when you feel like it's a never ending battle. Once my metabolism slowed down it seemed like it was impossible to keep my thin figure. I've felt so insecure about it and I think about it a lot! I thought that buying a dress too small would force me to get smaller, but then I realized it had the opposite effect and that it was discouraging me more because even when i'd lose an inch.. it wouldn't make a difference when I tried to put the dress on. \n \nI'm sorry to hear about the weight gain and health issues <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> I know how discouraging it can be. I hope things get better and i'm sending positive vibes! I agree though, it's best not to put the added pressure on yourself especially with the stress of a wedding. We're all beautiful regardless of the extra pounds and I need to tell myself that more often.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430867047,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85768,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm afraid I've pretty much given up on the weight battle. I'm old. That's it plain and simple. I did so well last year, even though 14 lbs was from throwing up all the time after my surgery lol but I figured hey - I'm ahead of the game now. It was a total of 25 lbs, which on a shorty like me...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1895466\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430866761,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85733,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Dress - Never Worn....","Message":"Hello!\n\nkrystalball just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"krystalball\" data-cid=\"1895444\" data-time=\"1430861993\">This is my dress: http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844\n \n...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79150-wedding-dress-never-worn-mermaid-style\/?view=findpost&p=1895460\n","Sender":{"Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1429976010","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430864793,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85732,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Dress - Never Worn....","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"krystalball\" data-cid=\"1895444\" data-time=\"1430861993\">This is my dress: http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844\n \n...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79150-wedding-dress-never-worn-mermaid-style\/?view=findpost&p=1895460\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430864751,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85651,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Meandhim mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1895441\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"\nYay! Can't wait to meet you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> thanks for the compliment but I still feel like I'm very behind in planning. \n\n@\"perianjay\" Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\n@\"diadiamond\"\n\nThank you, I find no one really writes about how crappy planning can be sometimes...lol...I'm sure some people are screaming blasphemy! At me right now...ha! I'm sorry to hear you were having challenges with your planning too, it sucks! I'm Glad to hear you are back on track now. I am of the mind that everything happens for a reason so maybe it's all for the best. I hope that your planning is much smoother from here on in! I can't wait to hear about it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\n@\"veryvalentine\"\nI just love the bottles... I'm going to try to make a trial one this weekend... See how it goes <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\nLol love that your dad got you the mugs so funny! It's really cute! It's cheesy but it's now a \"wedding story\" which is so awesome! You'll look at that mug in 10years and it will still make you laugh I bet!\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430845407,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85638,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'll get to meet you when you get my dress bag!! lol You'll be so close to your wedding by then!!!\nGood lord in heaven. Two weeks of overtime and I'm so far behind!!!\n \nFirst of all @  what a sweet thing to do!! How cool is that!\n \n@calgarybride2015...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1895427\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430842993,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85633,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1895436\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"TinkerSofi\" Exactly! I don't doubt myself and I do know that I can lose some weight for the wedding, but my issue was having a set size that I needed to get to. It was seeming almost like the goal was unrealistic. I'd prefer to lose weight at a pace that doesn't overwhelm or stress me out. I always find it harder when you are trying to lose that last few pounds! You can do it though <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n@\"acw271011\" Great! Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I did remember tygrrlily mentioning that as well. Also @\"Wafflesmom\" bought hers as a black Friday sale. I've been waiting for a few months now and i'm thinking it's about time they should get a sale going <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> haha\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430842190,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85625,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI think one of the past brides from here said that wedding chicks has a couple of sales a year, and if I remember correctly one of them is Labour Day, plus I think near Fourth of July, which is right on top of the Canada day holiday. if you're signed up they'll email it to you. Tyrgrlily got h...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1895434\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430842037,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85614,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOh my goodness you ladies always find a way to give me a chuckle. I keep asking Doug if he can walk and chew gum at the same time! If I try to talk to him while he's on the computer, or on his tablet, or even watching tv, I get this look like \"what planet did you just drop from and why are you...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1895433\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430841315,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85595,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nbeckys98 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'll get to meet you when you get my dress bag!! lol You'll be so close to your wedding by then!!!\nGood lord in heaven. Two weeks of overtime and I'm so far behind!!!\n \nFirst of all @  what a sweet thing to do!! How cool is that!\n \n@calgarybride2015...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1895427\n","Sender":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430840747,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85562,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nPhotographer is another biggy so one more thing off the list! it's one I struggled with but ours is done too, thank goodness.\n \nLove the thread!  And like the other ladies your \"how we met\" is great so yeah, a DW would be your only option! lol Couldn't see you doing it an...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1895426\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430839132,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85502,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"vancouverpetunia\" data-cid=\"1894002\" data-time=\"1429733099\"><p>Received my first wedding-related online purchase today. YAY! Kimonos for me and my 2 BMs. Thanks&nbsp;@  for posting the La Vie en Rose sale. Great deal!&lt...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1895344\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430833817,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85458,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79150-wedding-dress-never-worn-mermaid-style\/?view=findpost&p=1895387\n\n----------------------------------\nThank you! @\"acw271011\" It honestly makes me a bit sad to have to sell it.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430827079,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85457,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Dress - Never Worn....","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThat is stunning! I wish I was that size!! lol I'm sure you'll get it sold very quickly!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79150-wedding-dress-never-worn-mermaid-style\/?view=findpost&p=1895386\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1430827037,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85433,"Title":"liked a post you made in Where To Sell Bridal Gown?","Message":"Hello!\n\nmarinah84 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1895341\" data-time=\"1430786141\"><blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"acw271011\" data-cid=\"1895336\" data-time=\"1430793157\">There is also a site called preownedweddingdresses.com  I have no idea if they charg...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79108-where-to-sell-bridal-gown\/?view=findpost&p=1895343\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430824253,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85410,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nveryvalentine has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"your resort\".\n\nveryvalentine said:\n======================================================================\nHi there!   Hope you are doing well!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n \nSo my fianc\u00e9 and have been to the Grand Sunset Princess 2 twice, in the past 2 years because we loved it sooo much. \n \nWe loved it so much that we've booked our wedding to take place at the Grand Sunset Princess. \n \nWe were able to book our guests at the Platinum Yucatan Princess Resort for all the adult guests and the families are booking at the Grand Sunset Princess.\n \nGrand Sunset Princess & Grand Riviera Princess are essentially mirrors or each other.  Prior to the Adults only hotel opening, the Grand Riviera Princess hotel specialized in Adults only sections.  They have their separate lobby entrances and their own buffets but as a guest you can cross over to either area. \n \nAs of September 1, 2014, The Princess opened up their Adults only hotel, allowing guests of the adults only to cross over to GSP or GRP.  Guests of GSP & GRP cannot cross over to the Adults only.  The GSP and GRP now specialize as a family hotel and have focused more of their branding towards catering to children.\n \nI have heard nothing but great things about the new hotel.  I think that the Princess hotels have an amazing price point and are a bit of a hidden gem.\n \nWe will be heading out June 14th, and returning June 24th so I can let you know then for sure! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9620&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430821930,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9620},{"Id":85286,"Title":"liked a post you made in Question About Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSmellsey just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOf course you need to do a thread!! Almost everyone does, and the ladies love to read them!!!\n \nYou can see that the timeline varies a lot from one bride to another. We're still 6 months out from our renewal, and I started just jotting ideas down. Some ladies start at a year o...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79123-question-about-planning-threads\/?view=findpost&p=1894730\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430756435,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85184,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that diadiamond mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79135-help-i-was-diagnosed-with-pcos\/?view=findpost&p=1895268\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Thank you for sharing your experience and your advice I really do appreciate it! Thanks for the support.  \n \nI always knew that my weight was a problem, but I guess I was in denial for a while as I didn't think I was unhealthy.  It was definitely a hard pill to swallow when my doctor told me how much weight I needed to lose.  It was a huge wake-up-call for me, but I know that I definitely need to do something.\n \nSince I got my diagnoses last week I've made major lifestyle changes.  I now am careful with what I eat, so I'm sticking to a lower calorie diet.  I also eat more veggies and limit my carbs, dairy, and fruit.  I've been very sedentary for the last year, so I started going for 30-60 minute walks everyday to get some exercise.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1392867144","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430734147,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85181,"Title":"liked a post you made in Help!  I Was Diagnosed...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndiadiamond just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFormer PCOS here. And I have 2 boys, both 33 (they're 10 and a half months apart in age and for 6 weeks every year they're the same age between April 20th and May 27th). I will be honest and say that I did have trouble with the first getting pregnant, but then the second was super quick. I was...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79135-help-i-was-diagnosed-with-pcos\/?view=findpost&p=1895205\n","Sender":{"Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1392867144","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430733673,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85139,"Title":"liked a post you made in Michaels And Diy","Message":"Hello!\n\nRuzanna just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  is totally right! I've also looked at a couple of things and discovered that the exact same thing is cheaper in Walmart. Then I got a real shock and went across the border to the US!! I had to buy replacement blades for a cutter. They were 11.99 here at Michaels. I went across the border to...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79125-michaels-and-diy\/?view=findpost&p=1894781\n","Sender":{"Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430690926,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85084,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1895200\" data-time=\"1430614970\">Oh and here is a picture of my \"something old\" robe haha <a data-ipb='...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1895207\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430662266,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"413","TotalPages":14,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":6,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
