{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"ddb2198648ab183eb76b9d711518b13b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am totally biased, so I vote for the ones I got, or #1 :). I think #1 are really fun, but my faves are still the Nina ones from Nordstrom haha (of course I&#039;d say that, right?)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You will honestly not regret the Nordstrom ones. By the way, something I didn&#039;t mention, I did find the color was brighter in person than on the website, so plan for the blue to be less pale ;)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893649,"PostDate":1429490859,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am totally biased, so I vote for the ones I got, or #1 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I think #1 are really fun, but my faves are still the Nina ones from Nordstrom haha (of course I'd say that, right?)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You will honestly not regret the Nordstrom ones. By the way, something I didn't mention, I did find the color was brighter in person than on the website, so plan for the blue to be less pale <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ad1d06e9485a555e7e965989a28cf37","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1893647\" timestamp=\"1429503490\"]\n@[member=\"acw271011\"] how did I miss your thread? I read from the beginning and I&#039;m so glad I found\nit. You have wonderful ideas and your taste in wedding dresses is great! I love the story about how you and your hubby met and I admire your strength. I&#039;m so glad that you guys are renewing your vows.[\/quote]\nThank you. That&#039;s really nice. I look back at the last 3 and a half years and sometimes I wonder why things have gone the way they have. Ours is not to question why.... I know that and everything happens for a reason, but there are days that I can&#039;t help but wonder what the reason is. \n[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1893649\" timestamp=\"1429505259\"]\nI am totally biased, so I vote for the ones I got, or #1 :). I think #1 are really fun, but my faves are still the Nina ones from Nordstrom haha (of course I&#039;d say that, right?)\n\nYou will honestly not regret the Nordstrom ones. By the way, something I didn&#039;t mention, I did find the color was brighter in person than on the website, so plan for the blue to be less pale ;)[\/quote]\nThey&#039;re all Nina shoes, but just not from the Nordstrom site. They&#039;re right from the Nina site. That&#039;s good to know about the blue like yours. I totally LOVE the style - they&#039;re gorgeous, but yeah I was thinking the blue was lighter than what I wanted. Good to know it&#039;s brighter. I do like the colour in number 1 but the lower heel is what I liked about the other two. I&#039;m a total shoe slut lol so I would quite happily take them all but Doug would have a fit!!! For Mexico, he&#039;s already asking me how many of my 25 pairs of flip flops I&#039;m taking!!! And I&#039;m already eyeing up what&#039;s out for this year!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893652,"PostDate":1429492580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 20 April 2015 - 12:18 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> how did I miss your thread? I read from the beginning and I'm so glad I found<br>\nit. You have wonderful ideas and your taste in wedding dresses is great! I love the story about how you and your hubby met and I admire your strength. I'm so glad that you guys are renewing your vows.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you. That's really nice. I look back at the last 3 and a half years and sometimes I wonder why things have gone the way they have. Ours is not to question why.... I know that and everything happens for a reason, but there are days that I can't help but wonder what the reason is.\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 20 April 2015 - 12:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am totally biased, so I vote for the ones I got, or #1 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I think #1 are really fun, but my faves are still the Nina ones from Nordstrom haha (of course I'd say that, right?)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You will honestly not regret the Nordstrom ones. By the way, something I didn't mention, I did find the color was brighter in person than on the website, so plan for the blue to be less pale <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They're all Nina shoes, but just not from the Nordstrom site. They're right from the Nina site. That's good to know about the blue like yours. I totally LOVE the style - they're gorgeous, but yeah I was thinking the blue was lighter than what I wanted. Good to know it's brighter. I do like the colour in number 1 but the lower heel is what I liked about the other two. I'm a total shoe slut lol so I would quite happily take them all but Doug would have a fit!!! For Mexico, he's already asking me how many of my 25 pairs of flip flops I'm taking!!! And I'm already eyeing up what's out for this year!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.36.109","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"babc62a2ddc9073e4ca29abbdc02c52f","RawContent":"@[member=\"acw271011\"]  I like the first pair best... Blue is my favourite colour! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1893654,"PostDate":1429514636,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                 @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a>  I like the first pair best... Blue is my favourite colour! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"64b80b4b6462b02633ff9b7edbb282a4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1893652\" timestamp=\"1429506980\"]\nThank you. That&#039;s really nice. I look back at the last 3 and a half years and sometimes I wonder why things have gone the way they have. Ours is not to question why.... I know that and everything happens for a reason, but there are days that I can&#039;t help but wonder what the reason is. \n\n\nThey&#039;re all Nina shoes, but just not from the Nordstrom site. They&#039;re right from the Nina site. That&#039;s good to know about the blue like yours. I totally LOVE the style - they&#039;re gorgeous, but yeah I was thinking the blue was lighter than what I wanted. Good to know it&#039;s brighter. I do like the colour in number 1 but the lower heel is what I liked about the other two. I&#039;m a total shoe slut lol so I would quite happily take them all but Doug would have a fit!!! For Mexico, he&#039;s already asking me how many of my 25 pairs of flip flops I&#039;m taking!!! And I&#039;m already eyeing up what&#039;s out for this year!!![\/quote]well, I did my taxes the other day and since I had some money left over I decided to keep both the champagne and the pink ones haha but I&#039;m wearing the pink ones for the wedding :rolleyes: . I have so many dresses that can go with either that both will get used :).\n\n#2 are nice as well and since they are lower they will be more comfortable. I also think they&#039;ll get more use than #3. Don&#039;t order more than one though because you won&#039;t be able to decide, like me hahah, and then end up keeping both.","Attachments":[],"Id":1893664,"PostDate":1429522716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 20 April 2015 - 01:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you. That's really nice. I look back at the last 3 and a half years and sometimes I wonder why things have gone the way they have. Ours is not to question why.... I know that and everything happens for a reason, but there are days that I can't help but wonder what the reason is.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They're all Nina shoes, but just not from the Nordstrom site. They're right from the Nina site. That's good to know about the blue like yours. I totally LOVE the style - they're gorgeous, but yeah I was thinking the blue was lighter than what I wanted. Good to know it's brighter. I do like the colour in number 1 but the lower heel is what I liked about the other two. I'm a total shoe slut lol so I would quite happily take them all but Doug would have a fit!!! For Mexico, he's already asking me how many of my 25 pairs of flip flops I'm taking!!! And I'm already eyeing up what's out for this year!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>well, I did my taxes the other day and since I had some money left over I decided to keep both the champagne and the pink ones haha but I'm wearing the pink ones for the wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/rolleyes.gif' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':rolleyes:' \/>\u00a0. I have so many dresses that can go with either that both will get used <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>#2 are nice as well and since they are lower they will be more comfortable. I also think they'll get more use than #3. Don't order more than one though because you won't be able to decide, like me hahah, and then end up keeping both.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebdbfb5e30fa043f3148b3b11015f69a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ha extra money is always nice but two pairs of shoes - that&#039;s the BEST!!! lol told you...... total shoe slut here!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893721,"PostDate":1429536052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ha extra money is always nice but two pairs of shoes - that's the BEST!!! lol told you...... total shoe slut here!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.46.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"254d3639137ff6f7eba5e1e356a13d1c","RawContent":"Hi! I actually have that third turquoise pair sitting at my desk right now! I have been having extreme indecision on my shoe choice and bought 5 pairs online to try. I like those because the heel height is very sensible but they are still fancy! The color is gorgeous and they are very comfortable, but I went with a small wedge shoe instead.\n\nI agree that you probably wouldn&#039;t wear them again, or at least I wouldn&#039;t!\n[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1893640\" timestamp=\"1429498224\"]\nRight. time to get help again please. Shoes. I knew I wanted blue. The question is what colour of blue. Thanks to @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] the question of shoes has come to the forefront and she has fabulous taste!! lol\n\nSo - here are a couple that I&#039;m looking at:\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=31627\"]blue shoes.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=31628\"]more blue shoes.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=31629\"]turquoise shoes.jpg[\/url]\n\n\nWhat do you think? Oh then there&#039;s also the blue ones the same as @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] &#039;s pink ones, which are super, super gorgeous!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1893726,"PostDate":1429538041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! I actually have that third turquoise pair sitting at my desk right now! I have been having extreme indecision on my shoe choice and bought 5 pairs online to try. I like those because the heel height is very sensible but they are still fancy! The color is gorgeous and they are very comfortable, but I went with a small wedge shoe instead.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree that you probably wouldn't wear them again, or at least I wouldn't!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 19 April 2015 - 10:50 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Right. time to get help again please. Shoes. I knew I wanted blue. The question is what colour of blue. Thanks to @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> the question of shoes has come to the forefront and she has fabulous taste!! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So - here are a couple that I'm looking at:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=31627' class='bbc_url' title=''>blue shoes.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=31628' class='bbc_url' title=''>more blue shoes.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=31629' class='bbc_url' title=''>turquoise shoes.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What do you think? Oh then there's also the blue ones the same as @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> 's pink ones, which are super, super gorgeous!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.204","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9c6aac7785e3bc14f818197d6c66649","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1893721\" timestamp=\"1429550452\"]\nHa extra money is always nice but two pairs of shoes - that&#039;s the BEST!!! lol told you...... total shoe slut here!!![\/quote]I love shoes but it&#039;s hard for me to find comfy ones so when I do I hang on to them! Haha. I do love #1 but I&#039;d probably have to take them off after the ceremony and photos haha \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1893734,"PostDate":1429541113,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 20 April 2015 - 01:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Ha extra money is always nice but two pairs of shoes - that's the BEST!!! lol told you...... total shoe slut here!!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI love shoes but it's hard for me to find comfy ones so when I do I hang on to them! Haha. I do love #1 but I'd probably have to take them off after the ceremony and photos haha <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"094953fb4d6148570886948264de3fbd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I found a page at the nina site where the colors are really close to the real ones, so this is what the blue ones look like:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/ninashoes.com\/vinnie-new-dusty-blue-luster-satin--18202?c=714&#039;&gt;http:\/\/ninashoes.com\/vinnie-new-dusty-blue-luster-satin--18202?c=714&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893760,"PostDate":1429561318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I found a page at the nina site where the colors are really close to the real ones, so this is what the blue ones look like:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/ninashoes.com\/vinnie-new-dusty-blue-luster-satin--18202?c=714' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/ninashoes.com...in--18202?c=714<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eebc90e1556f4a1f7e26559c81ae89cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"beckys98\"] So did you decide to keep the turquoise ones? I like them and I thought it would be a good colour to match what hubby is wearing. But I really would like a bright blue pair.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@tinkersofi&amp;nbsp; I love number 1 but yeah, I&#039;m worried about the heel height. that&#039;s why I was asking you about yours. I have lousy knees - a consequence of wearing 4 inch heels when I was&amp;nbsp;a WHOLE lot younger, and arthritis - so heels and I really just do not get along. having said that, every once in a while I find a pair with a heel that are just so totally comfortable, they break in easily and I can wear them with no problem.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had beautiful high sandals when I got married. loved them!! they&#039;re still in my closet 4 years later. I lasted about an hour with them on then I went to flip flops and wore those for most of the rest of the day while we did pictures. I switched back to the heels for dinner then back to the flip flops again. I really would like to find a blue pair that I can wear for as much of the day as possible.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893822,"PostDate":1429620342,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> So did you decide to keep the turquoise ones? I like them and I thought it would be a good colour to match what hubby is wearing. But I really would like a bright blue pair.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@tinkersofi\u00a0 I love number 1 but yeah, I'm worried about the heel height. that's why I was asking you about yours. I have lousy knees - a consequence of wearing 4 inch heels when I was\u00a0a WHOLE lot younger, and arthritis - so heels and I really just do not get along. having said that, every once in a while I find a pair with a heel that are just so totally comfortable, they break in easily and I can wear them with no problem.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had beautiful high sandals when I got married. loved them!! they're still in my closet 4 years later. I lasted about an hour with them on then I went to flip flops and wore those for most of the rest of the day while we did pictures. I switched back to the heels for dinner then back to the flip flops again. I really would like to find a blue pair that I can wear for as much of the day as possible.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"efcf21af323c6265aa00fbbefccf3e92","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1893822\" timestamp=\"1429634742\"]\n@[member=\"beckys98\"] So did you decide to keep the turquoise ones? I like them and I thought it would be a good colour to match what hubby is wearing. But I really would like a bright blue pair.\n\n@tinkersofi  I love number 1 but yeah, I&#039;m worried about the heel height. that&#039;s why I was asking you about yours. I have lousy knees - a consequence of wearing 4 inch heels when I was a WHOLE lot younger, and arthritis - so heels and I really just do not get along. having said that, every once in a while I find a pair with a heel that are just so totally comfortable, they break in easily and I can wear them with no problem.\n\nI had beautiful high sandals when I got married. loved them!! they&#039;re still in my closet 4 years later. I lasted about an hour with them on then I went to flip flops and wore those for most of the rest of the day while we did pictures. I switched back to the heels for dinner then back to the flip flops again. I really would like to find a blue pair that I can wear for as much of the day as possible.[\/quote]I love finding those gems of heels that are just magical. They look great and are so comfortable. The unicorns of heels hahah.","Attachments":[],"Id":1893849,"PostDate":1429630218,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 21 April 2015 - 12:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> So did you decide to keep the turquoise ones? I like them and I thought it would be a good colour to match what hubby is wearing. But I really would like a bright blue pair.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@tinkersofi\u00a0 I love number 1 but yeah, I'm worried about the heel height. that's why I was asking you about yours. I have lousy knees - a consequence of wearing 4 inch heels when I was\u00a0a WHOLE lot younger, and arthritis - so heels and I really just do not get along. having said that, every once in a while I find a pair with a heel that are just so totally comfortable, they break in easily and I can wear them with no problem.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had beautiful high sandals when I got married. loved them!! they're still in my closet 4 years later. I lasted about an hour with them on then I went to flip flops and wore those for most of the rest of the day while we did pictures. I switched back to the heels for dinner then back to the flip flops again. I really would like to find a blue pair that I can wear for as much of the day as possible.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I love finding those gems of heels that are just magical. They look great and are so comfortable. The unicorns of heels hahah.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":98,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":5,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
